    <string name="about">The story moves forward one incident a day, skandha by skandha, from the sages of Naimisharanya to Markandeya\'s vision and the glory of the Bhagavatam, then starts again. Every incident has a classical painting, included in the app: Bhagavata Purana folios from the Pahari, Kangra and Rajasthani schools, works by Raja Ravi Varma and more, from Wikimedia Commons. Each painting\'s artist, licence and source are shown under its story.</string>
